  "notes": [
    "Expansion rule: admit a fresh20k confirmation if the 5k point estimate exceeds -11.4275 and both seat point estimates are above -50 bb/100. Treat a wide CI overlapping the historical Standard10 interval as underpowered rather than method rejection. Reject external alignment only if the raw 95% upper bound is below -11.4275 and both seat point estimates are below -25 bb/100. Any evidence/frozen/session failure invalidates the run.",
    "The first gate-summary invocation failed before reading evidence because its new script omitted the scripts import path. The corrected invocation used identical raw inputs and produced gate_summary.json; no Slumbot session was rerun or replaced.",
    "The preregistered clear-rejection rule was not met: although the overall upper CI (-16.44) is below the Standard10 point estimate (-11.4275), seat1 was -24.9199 rather than strictly below -25. The registered outcome is therefore HOLD_FOR_DIAGNOSTIC, not rejection or 20k admission."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "The exact frozen dual-contract bundle completed eight independent fresh 625-hand sessions (5,000 total) at -54.53 bb/100 with raw 95% CI [-92.619,-16.441]. All 14,975 policy decisions replayed exactly; checkpoint/base/runtime hashes, raw evidence, tokens, seeds, and visible-deal streams passed. Seat0 was -84.046 and seat1 -24.920 bb/100.",
    "conclusion": "External Slumbot direction contradicted the positive internal MGDA slope and failed the 20k admission rule. The strict preregistered clear-rejection rule missed by 0.080 bb/100 on seat1, so this is a diagnostic hold: seed0 12k external alignment is strongly concerning but the six-objective mechanism is not globally rejected from one noisy 5k checkpoint test.",
    "decision": "HOLD_MGDA_12K_EXTERNAL_ALIGNMENT_FOR_STATE_DIAGNOSTIC",
    "next_step": "Use the 5,000 untouched Slumbot trajectories for an outcome-aware but no-new-hands disagreement audit against frozen Standard10, stratified by seat/street/action and large losses. Determine whether the residual creates a localized deployable failure or whether internal proxy gains broadly fail to transfer before spending another fresh20k or increasing training dose."
  },
